cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
title: Digital Readiness for Cardiovascular Care
abstract: >-
  Analysis code linking cardiometabolic disease burden, cardiology workforce
  supply and digital readiness at the census-tract level, and classifying
  high-burden tracts in workforce-constrained counties into deployment-priority
  and investment-priority groups. Includes the full pipeline from public source
  files through the classification, ten sensitivity analyses, manuscript tables
  and figures, and the source for two accompanying browser dashboards.
type: software
